  "details": "Add a settings button to reset world video players\n\nWorld video players are known to be unreliable, with the video and sound completely cutting out client-side at certain times. Authors with worlds relying on video players have to add their own \"reset\" button to the world that will reset the video players for the user pushing the button. If the author doesn't add such a button, the only way to fix the video players is to rejoin the world. It would be more convenient to add a settings button to reset the video players.",
